<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>(v1.1) 

D.R.Q. aka Disco's Rage Quit is designed to quick-quit the game when you're absolutely fed up with Apex legends! This macro is universal to any and all resolutions and DPI, and it is GAME-UNIVERSAL! Rage quiting is no longer limited to Apex!

Version History: 

v1.0 - base
v1.1 - added delays to comply with rules</Description>
    <Comment>OSIRISSOFTWARE - SLSK - GSO</Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 226 1
KeyDown 61 1
Delay 10 ms
KeyUp 226 1
KeyUp 61 1</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Apex Legends</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>